# --- SECRETS: never commit ---
# GoogleDriveConfig reads /credentials.json from the classpath and stores OAuth
# tokens under tokens/. Both are per-user secrets. Anyone cloning this repo and
# wanting Drive mirroring supplies their own; without them the solver runs fine
# and simply skips uploading (see DriveUploader).
src/main/resources/credentials.json
credentials.json
tokens/
StoredCredential

